# No migrations without permission

Follow **`AGENTS.md`** at the repo root (section "Database migrations").

Never run `prisma migrate *`, `db push`, or any schema-apply command unless the user explicitly asks in that message. Writing migration files and `prisma generate` are OK. If migrate is needed, ask and wait.
